Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.71,0:00:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To a nurse, finding a vein can be routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,For a patient, it can feel like a long wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But sometimes, the technology meant to help\Nstill leaves the moment frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Because behind every vein\Nis a person waiting to feel reassured.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then another nurse noticed —\Nand offered a different way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She picked up VeinVision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time, she could see\Nthe veins more clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Less hesitation. Less waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And a patient who feels\Na little more at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:00:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,When you can see better,\Nyou can care better.
